{"author":{"id":"dec876858d28babbadcead4137861bf586626b8518cbce9c5f4fc52ac3b424b8"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1790966782,"nonce":"5QWwBtPGcAQtBKMKnUTHnFeu1qs=","title":"Canvases re-run their draw callback every frame off the scheduler. The compositor fast path","message":"`ElementType::Canvas` nodes execute their user-supplied draw closure inside the paint walker (`render_layer_with_motion`). The closure typically reads from a scheduler-driven timeline / animated value and emits primitives accordingly. With the compositor fast path engaged the walker doesn't run, so the closure never fires, so the cached primitives stay at last-walked state. Symptom in `examples/keyframe_canvas`: spinning loader / pulsing dots only animate while the mouse is moving (input invalidates the cache → forced full paint → walker runs once → frozen again).\n\n**Why:** The compositor fast path's mental model is \"tree didn't change, only motion values moved\" — but a Canvas's *output* changes every frame even though its tree shape doesn't. The cache key is too coarse to capture that.\n\n**How to apply:** Any \"skip the walker\" optimisation must include a canvas-presence check. Today this lives on [RenderTree::had_canvas_painted](crates/blinc_layout/src/renderer/mod.rs) (set inside [render_layer_with_motion](crates/blinc_layout/src/renderer/paint/motion.rs) whenever a Canvas intersects the viewport, reset at the top of every full paint). The windowed runner's `try_fast_paint` gate ANDs in `!tree.had_canvas_painted()` alongside the existing `!css_active \u0026\u0026 !scroll_animating` gates. The flag is unconditional on `visible_anim_active.get()` — canvas presence must be recorded even when some other signal already raised the visibility flag, otherwise a downstream canvas after an earlier-rising sibling gets silently ignored.\n\nSymmetric reasoning applies to any future fast-path optimisation that depends on cached output: SVG with `currentTime`-bound `\u003canimate\u003e` tags, GPU custom passes with time uniforms, etc. The cache is only valid as long as the user-visible output is fully determined by the bindings we track.\n\nSee also [[gotcha-fast-path-visible-anim-latch]] and [[gotcha-scrollbar-spring-spin]].","files":null}]}